> > > > mu_alpha     -0.8     0.9 1.9 -4.0 -2.6 -0.6  0.7   2.5      4    2.0
> > > > mu_beta       2.9     1.8 2.8 -1.2  0.7  1.7  5.5   8.1      2     2.7
> > > > mu_gamma     0.8     0.3 0.5  0.3  0.5  0.7  1.2   1.9    3  2.5
> > > > sigma_alpha  3.4     1.1 1.9  1.1  1.8  2.9  4.6   7.9     3   1.9
> > > > sigma_beta   5.1     1.6 2.8  1.6  2.7  4.4  6.9  11.7     3   1.9
> > > > sigma_gamma  0.5     0.2 0.3  0.1  0.3  0.4  0.6   1.1   3  2.1
> > > >
> > > >
> > > > Thanks,
> > > >
> > > > Rick
