Subject: Re: [stan-users] feature request for rstan
Message-ID: <HBewhdW1u88.75COxp5mm4gJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <HBewhdW1u88.kM8DU5QPVt4J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
