We're thinking we might be able to simplify some of these
models with functions or other built-in distributions.

I don't think we want to go down the route of automatically
transforming user programs --- the Matt trick (aka non-centered
parameterizations), for instance, is only advisable when there's
relatively little data, for instance.  And I at least would like
to keep the relation between program and code as transparent as possible.

Adding constraints like the one specified would require
doing some symbolic math, which is a little beyond us, at
least for the time being.

- Bob

