The y[i]’s are the data in the model.  The y_rep[i]’s need to be defined in the generated quantities block using a random number generation call such as:
y[i] ~ normal_rng(mu[i],sigma);

Once you’ve done it, though, I recommend doing a graphical test rather than a p-value (see chapter 6 of BDA for more discussion of this issue).

A

