>>>>
>>>> half-normal?
>>>>
>>>> half-logistic?
>>>>
>>>> half-gumbel?
>>>>
>>>> And we may want to make different recommendations for optimization
>>>> and for Bayesian inference, right?
>>>>
>>>> - Bob
