Subject: Re: [stan-users] Using stan as an MCMC kernel within a bigger algorithm
Message-ID: <aWChDDz1YFI.o19Wd6FSuN0J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <aWChDDz1YFI._kAPIKx2a8IJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
