But under Sage, I do not get the "variable tracking size limit exceeded with -fvar-tracking-assignments, retrying without".

Also, does it build for you under Sage with clang++? It does for me. Just put

CC=clang
CXX=clang++

into a file at ~/.R/Makevars and then in R under Sage do

install.packages("rstan", type = 'source')

