From u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com  Mon Jul 28 22:28:25 2014
From: u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com (Ben Goodrich)
Date: Mon, 28 Jul 2014 22:28:25 +0000
Subject: Re: Nice vectorized multi_normal speedup
