On Thursday, July 31, 2014 12:44:58 PM UTC-4, Dora Zhou wrote:
> I have a matrix RR:

Firstly, you would want to pass this to Stan as a two-dimensional array of integers, rather than a matrix (which is assumed to be real), as in

int RR[35,2];

Secondly, looping over i and j to do

Sigma[i,j] <- x[i,j]; // remember the semi-colon

does not make sense because x is declared as a one-dimensional vector. Perhaps you intended x to be declared as a matrix?

Ben

